evidence = "[meta] still declares name='attestor-api', version='1', mutual TLS 1.3, JSON bodies and the same categorized error_shape. The schema now includes op.keys.public_wallet, op.authority, op.sign.native, op.lx.review and op.evm.review sections, but still has no peer-route sections. op.sign kinds at line 171 omit both retired lx_activity and unsupported custody."

[row.r12-82.15]
